Ref:- Note of Principal secretary, Higher Education Department, Vide No.
21-Pr. Secy-HED/24 dt. 29.08.2024.

Sir,

In compliance of note of the Principal Secretary, HED Vide No 21- Pr.
Secy-HED/24 dt 29.08.2024, the matter has been reviewed and necessary
action has been taken as follows:-

1. Note of Pr. Secy., HED, has been circulated to all Govt. Engg. & Tech.
Colleges of West Bengal ( Copy attached).
2. Only one case of suspension was found in respect of Sri. Rajib Bal in
Kalyani Government Engineering College, Kalyani (KGEC) and college
furnished a preliminary report in the prescribed format ( Copy attached).
3. The Director of Technical Education, issued a letter to the college to
know about the detailed status report from police  & Sri. Rajib Bal
regarding his case Vide No. 44(T)/CS/(CS - 321/2024) ( Copy attached).
4. The Principal of KGEC has  issued a letter Vide Memo No.
KGEC/PERS/161/677 dt 12.09.2024 to Rajib Bal asking him to appear in person
before the principal, KGEC positively within 23.09.2024 with written
declaration about the details of case no. 656/16 dt. 08.11.2016 and present
status of case ( Copy attached).

On receipt of the reply the same will be intimated to the HED for taking
further necessary action.

Yours faithfully,

Director of Technical Education,
Govt. of West Bengal.

